            "terms": [
                [
                    "Tally",
                    "The running count of violence you've taken and dealt and kept walking away from. Fills during a fight, spent on Redline, never fully resets."
                ],
                [
                    "Redline",
                    "Spending Tally in one lump to push a strike, a block, or your own body past what's structurally sound. First one's clean each fight. Every one after risks a Slip (§3)."
                ],
                [
                    "The Answer",
                    "Your reflexive punishing strike — triggers automatically off an opening a foe hands you, no thought required. Functions as your reaction."
                ],
                [
                    "Trade",
                    "Both your weapon-group fluency and your fighting philosophy — the work you actually do. Chosen at 1st level; functions as your subclass (§2)."
